  "title": {
   "en": "Ookami wa Tsuki ni Koi wo Suru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "オオカミは月に恋をする"
   },
   {
    "en": "Wolf Falls in Love with Moon"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Nàng Sói Trót Phải Lòng Với Mặt Trăng"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I'm the only one who knows my senpai's face. Senpai, who was supposed to hate me, ended up saying \"I like you\" to me...\n\nThe perfect but slightly scary Student Council President, \"Wolf-senpai\" aka Ookamigawa Rina, and the frivolous and clumsy Vice-President, Tsukiyama Yuuga. These two are complete opposites of each other, save for the fact that both of them have a secret face. One day, at his secret part-time job, he discovers Wolf-senpai's secret face...?",
   "ja": "俺だけが知ってる、先輩の顔。俺のことが嫌いなはずの先輩に「好き」と言われてしまった───。\n\n完璧だけどちょっぴり怖い生徒会長、『オオカミ先輩』こと狼川琉奈。そして、チャラくてポンコツな副会長・月山雄牙。二人はなにもかも正反対。ーーーひとつ、お互いに秘密の顔があることを除いて。ある時、月山は秘密にしているアルバイトを通じて、オオカミ先輩の裏の顔を知ることになり…!?"
  },
